  "unresolved": [
    "Four official China barrel/front photographs in black and silver and the manual diagrams were visually inspected; they do not establish Nikon Z-specific color availability or complete rear/four-direction coverage. Click behavior and Nikon Z contacts remain unconfirmed; the manual primarily describes DSLR mounts.",
    "Japan/manual give approximately 74.8 x 82.2 mm and 609 g with mount variation/hood exclusion. China now gives approximately 82.2 x 74.8 mm for EF, 82.2 x 115 mm for RF, and 590 g for EF. Existing Z 75 x 83 mm and approximately 609 g are retained pending mount-specific reconciliation rather than adopting other-mount values.",
    "Japan gives 122.96 degrees while China/manual give 121.96 degrees; the existing 121.96-degree value is retained with the discrepancy and orientation unresolved.",
    "China describes a dedicated holder for 100 mm square filters and a 95 mm circular CPL; the manual says no filter thread. Existing empty filterInterfaces remains because the accessory interface mechanism is not established for the schema.",
    "The supplied hood is explicit in Japan; cap/case supply, environmental protection, external length behavior and precise main/auxiliary focusing-group classification remain unconfirmed. Global product-page access returned 403."
